ncomodá-las! Adiciona mais armas e items aos teu inventário (por um preço!) nas máquinas automáticas de venda! Pela primeira vez na franquia, usa e puxa o autoclismo das sanitas!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/707030/extras/c8e5705d1d07b367687c72656b3b83ee.poster.avif?t=1794195446\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/707030/extras/c8e5705d1d07b367687c72656b3b83ee.webm?t=1794195446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/707030/extras/c8e5705d1d07b367687c72656b3b83ee.mp4?t=1794195446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
